  "title": "Vertiv Introduces New Combination Outlet for Geist Rack PDUs to Simplify IT Equipment Provisioning and Upgrades in the Americas",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today introduced Vertiv™ Geist™ rack power distribution units (rPDU) with the new, patented Combination Outlet C13/C19 option that supports C14 and C20 plug types, simplifying the purchasing and provisioning of new rPDUs and other rack equipment. The Combination Outlet is available for shipment now in the Americas for single-phase applications from 120-208V.",
